	Problem description:  rgrn chases away new players who admit
to backing up save game files.  This is an indirect result of Nethack
not following the de-facto standard for game-saving.

	Proposed solutions:  

   o  Modify Explore mode to meet (or come closer to) the de-facto
      standard.  (For the benefit of everyone *except* Dave, note
      that the Guidebook says that Explore mode "...enables you to
      keep old save files and cheat death."  Dave is manually im-
      plementing Explore mode.)

   o  Make Explore mode more conspicuous.  (It is mentioned 90%
      of the way through a 50 page manual.  It is not actually
      described.)


